{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026cuk1A7G0Mm1792852040.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>高級組銀牌足球賽，大埔4-2擊敗傑志。</p><p></p><p>綠衫的大埔先失守，祖連奴轉身射入，34分鐘為傑志領先。保著優勢完半場，但換邊後不夠1分鐘，華力臣搶贏守衛，再扣過守衛射入，為大埔追平。</p><p></p><p>2分鐘後，費蘭度接應隊友回傳，遠射破網，反先2-1。加上張憙延在52分鐘，接應橫傳建功，大埔在12分鐘內入三球，由落後變成領先3-1。</p><p></p><p>艾華頓在4分鐘後，右路突破，再拉大位射入，一度為傑志追近。但尾段費蘭度再次遠射入網，大埔贏4-2，晉級四強。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T15:22:54.541918+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T08:20:09.070054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:26.769625+00:00","content_hash":"4eedc78044ad9bcdd33c33fa9390193e165903d011f38c388dbcc4e1fc60e4a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-24T15:22:54.541918+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}